e $x$-axis. So, under the action of the transformation, this point will be reflected $5$ units *below* the $x$-axis.\n\n![](images/15/15c5cadbce652b40c2507fe9457ba9d836239c63e232e4924fe03a1615e76817.png)\n\nWe conclude that the point $(3,-5)$ must lie on the graph of $y=-f(x).$"}]}
